            Type L copper over a 120-foot developed run on the default 28.34 psi friction budget — computed by
            the same code that runs the calculator above.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
            <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-500 bg-slate-50">
                  <th class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold">Demand</th>
                  <th class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold">Size</th>
                  <th class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold">Velocity</th>
